    <string name="stock_restore_confirm">Turn off every module and restore its saved stock state. HMG-Seogaemo stays installed. Automatic module calls and any saved update resume will stop. A head-unit restart may be required. If a conflict or failure occurs, restoration stops and backups are kept. Cancel leaves everything unchanged.</string>
